  "Counts are per executable. O = IR call occurrences; Opp = occurrences in positions the ingestion rule reaches; S = draft 1 probe statement-level sites; P = projected sites (independent re-implementation); T = stored non-opaque HAS_INVOCATION.",
  "classes lists the classification of every row the executable produces (empty: no row). mapping lists the mapping status of every key with at least one site or invocation, sorted, deduplicated.",
  "irShape is the canonicalised body as JSON, observed with build a93a98cead33 before freezing; a mismatch is a control failure.",
  "a1 compares statement-level steps with HAS_EFFECT: callSteps vs callEffects (non-opaque CALL_EXTERNAL), opaqueSteps vs opaqueEffects, unmatched counts after matching on kind, operation, argument count and conditional.",
  "A failure is scored as a miss and recorded; nothing is tuned."
 ],
